mbtcc
=====

This directory vendors a copy of mbtcc, a C compiler written in MoonBit.

  upstream : https://github.com/moonbitlang/mbtcc
  mirror   : https://github.com/Kaida-Amethyst/mbtcc
  commit   : 39d58ef3a405f1118199cace27e4d7f6d2a6f7b6

