Modifications
-------------
qbe.mbt maintains a modified code generator in this copy that targets the
qbe.mbt programmatic QBE IL builder (`azhzx/qbe`, the `ir_builder` package)
instead of MoonLLVM. Upstream does not accept pull requests, so these changes
are carried here as a vendored fork; the pristine upstream is pinned by the
commit above. See INTEGRATION.md for status and remaining work.
